  "description": "Despite the Kingdom of Blenheim having a woman on the throne, it is a nation made for men. Women are restricted in what they can do, and those who think differently are reminded of their place. But now comes four ambitious girls with their sights set not only on the crown, but also on a revolution! Whose eccentric vision will shape the fate of this great kingdom? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
